      11 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الهاجّ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِلْهِيجَاجٌ</span>, <i>It</i> (anything, S) <i>became mixed,</i> or <i>confused.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>It</i> (milk)
<i>thickened so that parts thereof became mixed together, but it did not become completely thick.</i> (S,
K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الهاجّت عَيْنُهُ</span> <i>His eye became infused</i> (lit.
mixed) <i>with drowsiness.</i> (S, K,) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  [See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُلْهَاجٌّ</span>.]

